{
  "name": "whatsapp_worker_despacho",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "09bcee2d-a63a-46ee-801d-6e53d251b7b9",
      "name": "Cada minuto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -920,
        180
      ],
      "notes": "paso 2: '...enviando un maximo de 10 mensajes espaciados uniformemente a razon de 1 mensaje por minuto'."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MILERN_API_BASE }}/api/v1/internal/despacho/siguiente",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.MILERN_INTERNAL_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "f2314e6d-fbba-44aa-b512-610626486d98",
      "name": "Reclamar esfuerzo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -700,
        180
      ],
      "notes": "El backend aplica las dos restricciones de caudal (10 por UE y 60 s entre mensajes) y toma el item con FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "hay-item",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.item }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "object",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "eb212a22-822a-408e-a3eb-6f31e9a4de94",
      "name": "Hay esfuerzo para enviar?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -480,
        180
      ],
      "notes": "Sin item (silencio, caudal o cola vacia) no se envia. WhatsApp no requiere chat_id de Telegram."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_BASE.replace(/\\/+$/, '') + '/message/sendText/' + encodeURIComponent($env.EVOLUTION_INSTANCE) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ number: '51991436832', text: $json.item.contenido, linkPreview: false }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "68dbda3c-784f-4f8a-8aff-147fe51a7af7",
      "name": "Enviar esfuerzo a WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        80
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Evolution API v2: POST /message/sendText/{instance}. Texto original sin escape HTML. Sin reintento HTTP automatico: los fallos pasan al backend."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MILERN_API_BASE }}/api/v1/internal/despacho/{{ $('Reclamar esfuerzo').item.json.item.id }}/confirmar",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.MILERN_INTERNAL_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ telegram_message_id: null }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "994e9e16-53ed-4eff-be8a-c9e3bbd250d7",
      "name": "Confirmar recepcion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Confirma solo tras respuesta valida de Evolution. El backend incrementa contadores y reagenda. Su contrato solo acepta ID numerico de Telegram: se envia null; key.id de WhatsApp queda en la ejecucion n8n. No reintentar automaticamente: confirmar no es idempotente."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MILERN_API_BASE }}/api/v1/internal/despacho/{{ $('Reclamar esfuerzo').item.json.item.id }}/fallo",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.MILERN_INTERNAL_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'fallo de envio en Evolution API v2').slice(0, 4000) }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "e6a5c016-8cb7-491b-8b57-8e394a8e9e76",
      "name": "Registrar fallo de envio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "notes": "El item vuelve a 'pendiente' hasta agotar DESPACHO_MAX_INTENTOS; el contador del nodo no se incrementa porque no hubo confirmacion."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cf51140e-5329-4a5d-a6d5-dab3c8a8ea15",
      "name": "Sin trabajo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fadafb92-de2d-44a2-a81e-37ad7eeafc43",
      "name": "Validar configuracion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -810,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "for (const name of ['EVOLUTION_API_BASE', 'EVOLUTION_INSTANCE', 'EVOLUTION_API_KEY']) {\n  if (!$env[name]?.trim()) throw new Error('Falta configurar ' + name);\n}\nif (!/^https?:\\/\\//.test($env.EVOLUTION_API_BASE)) throw new Error('EVOLUTION_API_BASE debe ser una URL HTTP(S)');\nreturn $input.all();"
      },
      "notes": "Valida antes de reclamar para no dejar un esfuerzo en_proceso por configuracion ausente."
    },
    {
      "id": "fabb8d46-699b-4f33-958b-ffa853886159",
      "name": "Validar respuesta Evolution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        80
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nif (typeof response.key?.id !== 'string' || !response.key.id.trim() || response.key.fromMe !== true || !['PENDING', 'SERVER_ACK', 'DELIVERY_ACK', 'READ', 'PLAYED'].includes(response.status)) {\n  throw new Error('Evolution API v2 no devolvio una confirmacion de envio valida');\n}\nreturn $input.all();"
      },
      "notes": "PENDING significa aceptado por Evolution, no leido por el destinatario. Rechaza respuestas vacias o de error antes de avanzar el aprendizaje."
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Cada minuto": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validar configuracion",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Reclamar esfuerzo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Hay esfuerzo para enviar?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Hay esfuerzo para enviar?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Enviar esfuerzo a WhatsApp",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Sin trabajo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validar configuracion": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Reclamar esfuerzo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Enviar esfuerzo a WhatsApp": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validar respuesta Evolution",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Registrar fallo de envio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validar respuesta Evolution": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Confirmar recepcion",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Registrar fallo de envio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": []
}
